{
	"info": {
		"_postman_id": "shiftflow-api-v2",
		"name": "SHIFTFLOW_API — Hetzner (shiftflow-api.duckdns.org)",
		"description": "# SHIFTFlow API\n\nREST API for managing tourist guide shift schedules at the Wieliczka Salt Mine.\n\n---\n\n## Quick Start\n\n1. Make sure containers are running: `shiftflow up -d`\n2. Run **🔐 Authentication → JWT Login** — `jwt_token` cookie is saved automatically by Postman\n3. All other requests use the cookie automatically (Postman Cookie Jar)\n\n---\n\n## Collection Variables\n\n| Variable | Default | Description |\n|---------|-----------------|------|\n| `base_url` | `https://shiftflow-api.duckdns.org` | API base URL |\n| `access_token` | *(auto after login)* | JWT token (9h TTL) |\n| `schedule_id` | `1` | Schedule ID for testing (April 2026, published) |\n| `shift_id` | `1` | Shift ID for testing |\n| `employee_id` | `2` | User ID for testing (akowal, manager) |\n| `position_id` | `1` | Position ID for testing |\n\n---\n\n## Test Accounts (after migrate:fresh --seed)\n\n| Login | Password / PIN | Role |\n|-------|------------|------|\n| `admin` | `password` | admin |\n| `akowal` | `password` | manager |\n| `tnowak` | PIN `1234` | employee |\n| `jwisn` | PIN `1111` | employee |\n| `knowak` | PIN `2222` | employee |\n| `pzajac` | PIN `3333` | employee |\n| `adabrow` | PIN `4444` | employee |\n\n---\n\n## Role Permissions\n\n| Endpoint | admin | manager | employee |\n|----------|-------|---------|----------|\n| Schedules CRUD | ✅ | ✅ | ❌ |\n| Shifts write | ✅ | ✅ | ❌ |\n| Shifts read | ✅ all | ✅ all | ✅ own (published only) |\n| Positions write | ✅ | ❌ | ❌ |\n| Positions read | ✅ | ✅ | ❌ |\n| Employees CRUD | ✅ | ❌ | ❌ |\n| Availabilities own | ✅ | ❌ | ✅ |\n| Availabilities all | ✅ | ✅ read only | ❌ |\n\n---\n\n## Key API Behaviours\n\n- `POST /shifts` → **410 Gone** — use `POST /schedules/{id}/shifts/batch` instead\n- CSV Import: hard limit of **500 rows** (501+ returns 422)\n- Availabilities: same user + date → **UPDATE** (upsert behaviour)\n- Shift times stored in **minutes** in the database (not hours)\n- Employees use soft deletes — historical shift data is preserved\n- JWT tokens are blacklisted on logout (Redis-backed)\n- Position `color` must be a valid hex color in `#RRGGBB` format",
		"schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
	},
